    "\n",
    "### Exercise 5: Plot the unnormalized XLF\n",
    "\n",
    "Create a figure showing the cumulative XLF of the selected XRB population.\n",
    "Use the total 0.5–8 keV luminosity `Lx_tot` for every XRB.\n",
    "\n",
    "</div>\n"
